      "source_notes": "**Notice: Please do not downgrade to 3.0.2 from newer firmware versions like 3.0.7 as this will break your device, a solution is incoming. Please [contact Innioasis](https://www.innioasis.com/pages/contact) if you have been affected by this,** \r\n\r\nNew in System Software 3.0.2:\r\n\r\nLanguage selection at first start-up for new users, in line with new retail units, users will be asked to select their language after installing the firmware, or when they take a new Y1 from the box.\r\n\r\nPerformance and stability improvements\r\n\r\nKnown issues:\r\nADB is currently not enabled on builds newer than 2.1.9. This means that screenshots will can not be taken on this release and that theme and file transfers using Smart Drop in updater will require you to have USB Storage Mode enabled.",
